    <h1>18 Days Silk Road & Northern Xinjiang Tour</h1>
    <div class="route">馃搷 Urumqi &#8594; Kanas &#8594; Ili &#8594; Turpan &#8594; Dunhuang &#8594; Kashgar</div>
    <div class="badge-row"><span>&#127807; Nature & Culture</span><span>&#11088; 4-Star Hotels</span><span>&#127891; English Guide</span><span>&#9992; Flights Included</span></div>
